{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063180/extras/c54cd1a3d8f0f85c25db8350e74242b5.avif?t=1761308166\" data-has-big width=1560 height=425 /></span>Step into a city where every choice matters. <i>DriftBorne</i> is a story-driven adult visual novel that combines mature storytelling, branching paths, and cinematic presentation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063180/extras/67e087a1cf302d7daf62bf9bf3b35069.avif?t=1761308166\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063180/extras/7fdb4661fb2f9d81683a4fd9eacece8c.avif?t=1761308166\" width=457 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your own path in a world of high stakes and hidden dangers. Season 1 begins with Episode One: explore the streets, meet a cast of unforgettable characters, and navigate branching storylines that shape not only your fate but theirs as well. Will you build lasting friendships, spark fiery rivalries, or ignite romances that change everything? Each decision pushes you deeper into mystery and drama. Where the shadows of your past, and those who would see your legacy undone, await at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063180/extras/8a9b7acd8cbe56704f95028c7201d36f.avif?t=1761308166\" width=415 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a world filled with interactive features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phone System:\u00a0</strong>A phone app where you can send messages and deepen your connections with other characters + more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personalized GUI:</strong> Enjoy a sleek, customized interface that enhances your experience and makes every choice feel impactful.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2\u20133 hours of gameplay</strong> packed with branching choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1,500+ high-quality renders</strong> and dozens of animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching storylines</strong> with meaningful player decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Karma system</strong> affecting character relationships and story outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mature content:</strong> sexual content, nudity, and violence presented with narrative context.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063180/extras/4b62d51d890c0dd3060e76b1f0a7e914.avif?t=1761308166\" width=353 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Season 1 consists of three planned episodes, beginning with Episode One.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future episodes will continue the story at no additional cost for all existing owners of Season 1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each release expands the cast, locations, and storylines while building toward the full Season 1 conclusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063180/extras/517de0ae1b85651f5dc0667a1da1c90c.poster.avif?t=1761308166\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063180/extras/517de0ae1b85651f5dc0667a1da1c90c.webm?t=1761308166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063180/extras/517de0ae1b85651f5dc0667a1da1c90c.mp4?t=1761308166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063180/extras/9009150313133ecf9063154e93b5cec7.avif?t=1761308166\" width=287 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of a highly successful visual novel spanning <strong>10 novels, 27,000+ images, 3,000+ animations, and 15 major updates over 4 years</strong>, <i>DriftBorne</i> continues a proven track record of delivering immersive, story-driven adult content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063180/extras/c1f1e7453613d57764658ccdc29aa3ba.avif?t=1761308166\" width=237 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the conversation:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discord server</strong> for direct feedback and discussions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Discussions</strong> to connect with players and developers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices\u2014and your voice\u2014matter here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Content &amp; Age Rating Disclosures:</u></i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Violence:</strong> Stylized but contextual.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sexual content &amp; nudity:</strong> Explicit; multiple partners; fetishes explored.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Language:</strong> Strong and mature.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Themes:</strong> Mystery, betrayal, ambition, survival.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is intended for <strong>adults only (18+)</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>DriftBorne Season 1 is only the beginning. Your choices will define the path forward. Will you rise above the streets, or drift into the unknown?</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4063180?t=1761308166","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063180/2fe5187c3424254adad464f585aa18db72d8b3b0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761308166","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063180/7c1e24ab053e04488827e784f46067c9e2a255cf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761308166","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063180/7c1e24ab053e04488827e784f46067c9e2a255cf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761308166","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,4,5],"notes":"The game contains blood, murder scenes, and depictions of crime scenes, with violence presented in a contextual, story-driven way. It also features sexual content, including consensual sexual acts and nudity, as well as mature themes and strong language."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063180/extras/c54cd1a3d8f0f85c25db8350e74242b5.avif?t=1761308166\" data-has-big width=1560 height=425 /></span>Step into a city where every choice matters. <i>DriftBorne</i> is a story-driven adult visual novel that combines mature storytelling, branching paths, and cinematic presentation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063180/extras/67e087a1cf302d7daf62bf9bf3b35069.avif?t=1761308166\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_im